From: mrdidit <26687854+mrdidit@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: wcd939x: preserve PCM ULP mode before PA enable

Both headphone PRE_PMU callbacks select the requested Class-H state and
then unconditionally replace its power mode with HiFi. For PCM ULP this
leaves the PA enabled in HiFi until POST_PMU restores power level 3 after
the startup delay. The Android WCD939x PCM ULP sequence does not force
this intervening HiFi mode.

Skip the forced HiFi mode only for PCM ULP on both channels. Preserve the
PDM and other-mode sequences, shared Class-H control calls, delays and
the existing POST_PMU power-level write.

Reference: Pocket S2 Android WCD939x PA callback audit and active route
captures. Audible improvement remains unvalidated.
---

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
@@ -839,7 +839,8 @@
 
 		wcd_clsh_ctrl_set_state(wcd939x->clsh_info, WCD_CLSH_EVENT_PRE_DAC,
 					WCD_CLSH_STATE_HPHR, hph_mode);
-		wcd_clsh_set_hph_mode(wcd939x->clsh_info, CLS_H_HIFI);
+		if (!wcd939x->hph_pcm_enabled || hph_mode != CLS_H_ULP)
+			wcd_clsh_set_hph_mode(wcd939x->clsh_info, CLS_H_HIFI);
 
 		if (!wcd939x->hph_pcm_enabled &&
 		    (hph_mode == CLS_H_LP || hph_mode == CLS_H_LOHIFI || hph_mode == CLS_H_ULP))
@@ -981,7 +982,8 @@
 
 		wcd_clsh_ctrl_set_state(wcd939x->clsh_info, WCD_CLSH_EVENT_PRE_DAC,
 					WCD_CLSH_STATE_HPHL, hph_mode);
-		wcd_clsh_set_hph_mode(wcd939x->clsh_info, CLS_H_HIFI);
+		if (!wcd939x->hph_pcm_enabled || hph_mode != CLS_H_ULP)
+			wcd_clsh_set_hph_mode(wcd939x->clsh_info, CLS_H_HIFI);
 
 		if (!wcd939x->hph_pcm_enabled &&
 		    (hph_mode == CLS_H_LP || hph_mode == CLS_H_LOHIFI || hph_mode == CLS_H_ULP))
